WEBVTT

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:32.255
I was even afraid to think in North Korea.

00:03:33.619 --> 00:03:35.930
We are told that he's starving for us,

00:03:35.954 --> 00:03:38.252
and he's working tirelessly for us,

00:03:38.276 --> 00:03:40.709
and my heart just broke for him.

00:03:41.802 --> 00:03:44.577
When I escaped to South Korea,

00:03:44.601 --> 00:03:48.540
people told me that
he was actually a dictator,

00:03:48.564 --> 00:03:50.332
he had cars,

00:03:50.356 --> 00:03:51.927
many, many resorts,

00:03:51.951 --> 00:03:54.890
and he had an ultraluxurious life.

00:03:56.803 --> 00:04:00.901
And then I remember
looking at a picture of him,